window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>PURPLE DRAGONFLY AWARD 2024. <br> <br> If Nema can’t uncover a lost boy’s true identity in time, they may never escape the sticky world he designed... </p> <p>When Nema and her friends discover a hidden sugar-hooked society holding lost kids, they find their perfect world in danger. The strange, sticky place hides the truth about Nema’s missing brother, and a plot to destroy the free life she knows. But only they can reverse a code to prevent a rock candy robot invasion and rescue the captives. Fail and they might never make it back home. </p> <p><i>Moojag and the Auticode Secret </i>is a quirky, Alice-esque cli-fi adventure written by an AuDHD author, featuring diverse autistic and neurodivergent characters, for listeners 10 years and up. Set in the utopian \"Real World\" of post-catastrophe \"Surrey Isles\", Britain 2054, where neurodivergents live in harmony with nature and technology. <br> <br> @moojagbook</p> <p>Full list of voices: Ria Lina (narrator), Indica Watson (narrator), Becky Davis, Sam Palmer, Simon Marchant, Tracy Foster, Harry Thompson, David Watson, Errol Kerr, Ciarán McGlynn, Tilley Milburn, Jack Monaghan, Emily Burke, Catti Goodbody, Duckie Nella Moriarty, Jaz Bigden, Mohamed Sillah, and Jordan Esau</p>"; 
